---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <div class="pill-row">
    <p class="pill">PhD Candidate in Bioengineering &middot; UC Berkeley/UCSF</p>
    <p class="pill">Biomaterials &amp; Tissue Regeneration</p>
  </div>
  <h1>Morgan R. Pfaff</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Bioengineer</p>
  <p>
    Hi, I'm Morgan! I design hyaluronic acid hydrogels that help muscle
    heal after complex soft tissue injuries, and I care just as much about
    getting that science out of the lab and into the hands of patients,
    students, and my community.
  </p>

  <h2>Right now</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Finishing my PhD</h3>
    <p>
      I'm wrapping up my dissertation in Dr. Kevin Healy's lab in the joint
      UC Berkeley/UCSF Bioengineering program, on viscoelastic,
      semi-synthetic hyaluronic acid hydrogels for soft tissue regeneration.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Moving the work toward the clinic</h3>
    <p>
      I'm a scientific consultant for MuscleMatrix, the startup built on
      hydrogel technology I co-invented, helping set up the company from the
      lab bench up.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Teaching and community</h3>
    <p>
      I'm a reader for two Berkeley bioengineering courses, guest lecture on
      hydrogels and polymers, and lead a weekly meal serve with Food Not
      Bombs East Bay.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="home-cta">
    <a class="btn" href="/research/">See My Research</a>
    <a class="btn secondary" href="/about/">More About Me</a>
  </div>
  <img
    src="/morgan-nu-portrait-hq.jpg"
    alt="Portrait of Morgan R. Pfaff outdoors on Northeastern's campus"
    class="card-img home-photo"
  />
  <p class="photo-credit">Photo by Matthew Modoono/Northeastern University</p>
</Layout>
